   "text": "Thanks, Sam. You're verified, and I've checked the order.\n\nThe courier's log for your Burger Barn order (Q-8001) shows this:\n- The courier picked it up at 6:47 PM and arrived at your address at 7:05 PM.\n- They called you at 7:06 and 7:09, and nobody answered.\n- At 7:15 PM the delivery was marked failed because the customer couldn't be reached.\n- The order went back to the restaurant at 7:28 PM.\n\nSo the food was never handed over. Our policy doesn't allow a refund or credit when a delivery fails because the courier couldn't reach the customer, so I can't refund this order. I'm sorry that's not the answer you wanted.\n\nIf you think the courier had the wrong contact details, or you were home and never got a call, tell me and I'll look at what else I can do. If you'd like to talk to a person about this, I can pass your case to a specialist."
